Skill: Canonical workflow shell protocol for terraform-module-update. **Single-command protocol** — paste spawn-contract script blocks into ONE `${ubuntu_tool_prefix}_execute_series`. Pair with orchestration-sop §3d/§3h.

Keywords: workflow scripts, execute_series, heredoc, stage-runner, clone, validate, commit, pr, discovery.

========================================================================
0) Single-command protocol (mandatory)
========================================================================

**Problem:** Guild `${ubuntu_tool_prefix}_execute_series` runs **each** command via `sh -c`. `/bin/sh` does **not** support bash function syntax. Separate commands do **not** share shell state.

**Hard rules:**
1. **`WORK_ROOT={{work_root}}`** — export in the command string; the one-liner creates the directory. Do **not** set `working_dir` to WORK_ROOT.
2. **`working_dir`** — set to `${ubuntu_integration_home}` (spawn context `execute_series_working_dir`) or **omit**. NEVER `$HOME/.wf-*` or `{{work_root}}` — MCP chdirs before the command runs.
3. **Exactly ONE** element in `execute_series.commands[]`. **Clone:** spawn-context line with inline pack ensure (TFBOT_* integration env) + `${tfbot_pack_dir}/clone-pack.sh`. **Discovery:** `${tfbot_pack_dir}/stage-runner.sh discovery-scaffold '{{work_root}}'` (never `"$WORK_ROOT/.pack/stage-runner.sh"`). **Validate:** `${tfbot_pack_dir}/stage-runner.sh validate-and-pr` with MODULE_PATH/REPO_FULL_NAME/ISSUE_OR_PR exports (never `VALIDATE_ONE_LINER` or inline `TRIGGER_JSON`).
4. **Never** `_embed_tfbot_run(){ … }`, `bash -lc`, multiple commands, or `${ubuntu_tool_prefix}_create_files` for the same stage.
5. **Never** reconstruct scripts from this skill — use spawn-context one-liners / `---BEGIN …---` blocks only.
6. **tftpl / goal safety:** in `.tftpl` embed scripts, double shell `$` signs (`$$` in tftpl → `$` in rendered bash). Never paste sed auth URLs into goals. **Clone:** never paste base64 one-liners.
7. After stdout `key=value` lines, mirror keys to `$WORK_ROOT/notes.json` (orchestration §3b).

**Stage-runner on disk:** `check-info-and-clone-clone` writes `$WORK_ROOT/.pack/stage-runner.sh`. Later stages call that file — do **not** re-embed the 24KB script in validate/discovery commands.

========================================================================
1) Spawn-contract blocks (authoritative — not this skill)
========================================================================

| Stage subagent | Spawn context block | Stdout sentinels |
|----------------|---------------------|------------------|
| `check-info-and-clone-clone` | `${tfbot_pack_dir}/clone-pack.sh clone …` | `repo_clone_path=`, `stage_runner_path=`, `repo_head_sha=` (40 chars), `script_pack_version=${script_pack_version}` |
| `implement-module-discovery-scaffold` | `${tfbot_pack_dir}/stage-runner.sh discovery-scaffold` + `TRIGGER_JSON_B64` | `module_paths=`, `fmt_exit=`, `discovery_greenfield_validated=true` |
| `validate-and-test-runner` | `---BEGIN VALIDATE_EXECUTE_SERIES---` | `fmt_exit=`, `module_quality_summary=`, `validate_markers_file=`, `test_summary_file=`, `test_summary_tail=` (when `test_exit=1`), `pr_url=`, `pr_draft=true` when tests fail |
| `implement-module-discovery-scaffold` | `${tfbot_pack_dir}/stage-runner.sh discovery-scaffold` | same validate markers + `test_summary_*` on inline validate failure |
| `create-pr-runner` | `---BEGIN COMMIT_PR_EXECUTE_SERIES---` | `pr_url=`, `working_branch=` |

**FORBIDDEN:** `printf` fake PASS, `load_skill` on clone/validate/create-pr runners, skill §1 script bodies (removed — too large for auto-summarization).

========================================================================
2) Stage → block mapping (planner)
========================================================================

| Stage | Subagent | Action |
|-------|----------|--------|
| `check-info-and-clone` | `check-info-and-clone-clone` | Architect notes webhook keys **first**; spawn with spawn_contract goal; runner exports `REPO_CLONE_URL` / `DEFAULT_BRANCH` / `ISSUE_OR_PR` from read_notes (never inline `TRIGGER_JSON='{…}'`) |
| `implement-module` (greenfield) | `implement-module-discovery-scaffold` | Paste spawn-context Discovery command (pack `stage-runner.sh`, real `TRIGGER_JSON_B64`) |
| `implement-module` (quality rework) | Template J — same subagent on discovery | Gap fixes in shell inside ONE series, then spawn-context Validate — planner goal ≤800 chars |
| `validate-and-test` | `validate-and-test-runner` | Paste VALIDATE block + `MODULE_PATH` export |
| `create-pr` | `create-pr-runner` | Paste COMMIT_PR block if `pr_url` missing |

Subagent goals: ONE `execute_series` — **never** `$WORK_ROOT/scripts/*.sh` paths or reconstructed heredocs from memory. Planner spawn goal ≤ ~800 chars — host replaces with spawn contract; never paste fix scripts into the goal (orchestration §5d/§5i).
